  "description": "Delivers queued outbound messages (message_id) to Telegram / WhatsApp and marks sent_at; also answers Telegram button presses (ack). A failed delivery is retried by cron.reconcile with backoff; a broken channel account or a message given up on alerts the platform chat. Channel tokens are decrypted here only; successful executions are not saved."
